WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:06.200
Before she’s even out of bed, Maya’s asking ChatGPT, “Does ‘fine’ mean he’s still annoyed?”

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:11.460
By lunch, it’s helping her figure out how to get through a to-do list she’s been avoiding since Monday.

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.940
By six, she’s texted the group chat.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.320
“Found us a rooftop for dinner. Under £25!”

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.820
The lift doors open.

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:20.080
Parking bays.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.240
A Toyota.

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:25.820
Next time the group chat asks where they’re eating, Maya adds one line to her prompt.

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:28.640
“Give me three places and link me to their menus.”

